000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lgmqmq13/d007765e-5799-49ff-b850-423f7095488c/77932c80-de2a-11ed-b148-8b01c4181132/file-1lgmqmq14.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Force of friction depends on roughness of two surfaces in contact. If roughness will increase, the force of friction will also increase.</p>"}]}